                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "02cc78c4-de7d-4b0f-8b09-c03bb984991c",
                                "sense_id": "880f889f-b7a6-36a2-9a48-3b1b6407cb7b",
                                "text": "While some have analyzed *nuráke of an *-ák-derivaton of a stem *nur-, which is supposedly found in Old Sardinian toponyms such as Nora, Nure, this analysis rests on formal similarity only […] As long as the semantic value of the element nur- cannot be established, it cannot be ruled out that *nurak- was monomorphemic."
                            }
                        ]
